{"type":"message","id":"2accd88d","parentId":"f0036a7d","timestamp":"2026-02-02T20:11:14.964Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I know the actual pages. Let me look at the right sheets - the construction floor plan (page 9 = A-101), door schedule (page 22 = A-701), finish schedule (page 25 = A-801), and more."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_013u59uobFWUt645SATsSDhR","name":"image","arguments":{"image":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-bellevue-hospital/drawings/pages/page_009.png","prompt":"This is the Construction Plan A-101 for the ED Ambulance Bay Addition at Bellevue Hospital. I need to extract ALL: 1) Room names and room numbers with dimensions, 2) Overall building footprint dimensions, 3) Door tags/numbers and locations, 4) Partition type callouts on walls, 5) Any area calculations shown. Be extremely thorough - list every room, every door, every dimension you can read."}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_014zudhBd2xnvEJzxfcMwGpu","name":"image","arguments":{"image":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-bellevue-hospital/drawings/pages/page_022.png","prompt":"This is the Door Schedule and Partition Types sheet A-701 for the Bellevue Hospital ED Ambulance Bay Addition. Extract ALL: 1) Every door in the door schedule with door number, width, height, type, frame type, hardware set, fire rating, and any notes. 2) Every partition type with full description/composition. 3) Door hardware legend. Be extremely detailed - list every single entry."}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_015R99oxJCjMJePpWwDApfNK","name":"image","arguments":{"image":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-bellevue-hospital/drawings/pages/page_025.png","prompt":"This is the Finish Schedule sheet A-801 for the Bellevue Hospital ED Ambulance Bay Addition. Extract ALL finish schedule data: every room number, room name, floor finish, base, wall finishes (N/S/E/W), ceiling type, ceiling height, and any notes. Also extract wall protection details and finish legends. Be extremely thorough."}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-opus-4-5","usage":{"input":1,"output":587,"cacheRead":52139,"cacheWrite":284,"totalTokens":53011,"cost":{"input":0.000005,"output":0.014675,"cacheRead":0.0260695,"cacheWrite":0.001775,"total":0.0425245}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1770063065307}}
{"type":"message","id":"2dfb10f6","parentId":"2accd88d","timestamp":"2026-02-02T20:11:29.183Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_013u59uobFWUt645SATsSDhR","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Construction Plan A-101 — ED Ambulance Bay Addition, Bellevue Hospital\n\n## Sheet Information\n- **Project:** H+H Bellevue, ED Ambulance Bay Addition\n- **Address:** 462 1st Avenue, New York, NY 10016\n- **Architect:** Array Architects, 200 Hudson Street, Suite 400, 14th Floor, New York, NY 10013\n- **Project No.:** 6629\n- **Date:** 09/25/25\n- **Scale (A6):** Overall Architectural Plan 1/4\" = 1'-0\"\n- **Scale (A1):** Proposed Concrete & Paving Diagram 1/8\" = 1'-0\"\n- **Issue:** #1 — Issued Solution for Bid, 09/25/25\n\n---\n\n## Grid Lines\n**Vertical (numbered):** 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8\n**Horizontal (lettered):** A, B, C, C.B, D, E, E.B, F, G.B\n\n---\n\n## Rooms / Spaces (with dimensions where legible)\n\n| Room / Space | Room # | Dimensions / Notes |\n|---|---|---|\n| **FLOOR DRAIN** | — | Near grid A-B / 8 |\n| **CART WASH** | — | Adjacent to floor drain area |\n| **SECURITY** | C.8 | Near grid A / 7, approx. 7'-7\" wide |\n| **MEP EQUIPMENT, BULLPEN, CABINETS, NORTH FLOOR (WITH RELOCATABLE/REMOVABLE EQUIPMENT WITHIN)** | C.7 | Grid A / 8 area, 7'-0\" dimension shown |\n| **HOSE BIBS** | — | Noted at wall near cart wash |\n| **ENTRANCE VESTIBULE** | — | ~16'-6 1/4\" wide, between grids 5-6 / row A-B |\n| **CART STORAGE** | — | Near entrance vestibule, grid 5/A area |\n| **LYPE SECURITY"}],"details":{"model":"anthropic/claude-opus-4-5","image":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-bellevue-hospital/drawings/pages/page_009.png","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1770063089167}}
{"type":"message","id":"e376a560","parentId":"2dfb10f6","timestamp":"2026-02-02T20:11:40.689Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_014zudhBd2xnvEJzxfcMwGpu","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Sheet A-701 — Door Schedule, Partition Types, Legends & Door Schedule\n\n## DOOR SCHEDULE - ED ADDITION\n\n| Door | Room Name | Width | Height | Type | Material | Frame Material | Glazing | Frame Type | Hardware Set | Fire Rating | Remarks |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| ED-01 | CART ROOM | 3'-0\" | 8'-0\" | — | P | AL | NA | SAL | 3'-0\" | SAL | — |\n| ED-1A | ENTRANCE VESTIBULE | 6' | 8'-0\" | P | AL | NA | SAL | 3'-0\" | SAL | — | — |\n| ED-1B | MPIE SECURITY PORCH | 6' | 8'-0\" | P | AL | NA | SAL | 3'-0\" | SAL | S5 | BALLISTIC LEVEL 3, DOOR FRAME AND GLAZING |\n| ED-1C | MPIE SECURITY PORCH | 6' | 2'-0\" | P | AL | NA | SAL | 5'-0\" | SAL | G1 | — |\n| ED-1E | ENTRANCE VESTIBULE | 1 | 4'-0\" | P | AL | NA | SAL | 12'-2 1/2\" | SAL | S3 | BALLISTIC LEVEL 3, DOOR FRAME AND GLAZING |\n| ED-1F | ENTRANCE VESTIBULE | 1 | 6' | 3'-0\" | AL | NA | SAL | 12'-2 1/2\" | SAL | S5 | — |\n| ED-1G | ENTRANCE VESTIBULE | 6' | 3'-0\" | P | AL | NA | SAL | 1'-0\" | NA | SAL | — |\n| ED-1H | ENTRANCE VESTIBULE | MA | 6'-0\" | 3'-0\" | HR | 7I | 3 | 6'-8\" | MA | MM | BALLISTIC LEVEL 3, DOOR FRAME AND"}],"details":{"model":"anthropic/claude-opus-4-5","image":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-bellevue-hospital/drawings/pages/page_022.png","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1770063100684}}
{"type":"message","id":"189c9a02","parentId":"e376a560","timestamp":"2026-02-02T20:11:55.104Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_015R99oxJCjMJePpWwDApfNK","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# FINISH SCHEDULE - Sheet A-801\n\n## Bellevue Hospital ED Ambulance Bay Addition\n\n---\n\n## FINISH SCHEDULE\n\n| Item | Manufacturer | Style | Color | Dimensions | Finish Notes | Location | Manufacturer's Rep |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| **CEILING** | | | | | | | |\n| C-1 | ARMSTRONG | OPH-9 OPTIMA HEALTH REFLEX/D TEGULAR | WHITE | 24\" X 24\" | FIRELINE 15/16 GRID | | THAROS CEIL 201-407-5227 |\n| C-2 | | GYPCEIL | | | | | |\n| **PAINT** | | | | | | | |\n| P-1 | BENJAMIN MOORE | EPOXY | RENOVATION PEACH WHITE - 2146-15 | | | GENERAL WALL PAINT (GYP CEILING & INT.) | ANIEMA OKON, 646-641-2196 |\n| P-2 | SHERWIN WILLIAMS | FLAT FINISH | CEILING WHITE | | | ANIEMA OKON, 646-641-2196 | |\n| P-3 | SHERWIN WILLIAMS | EPOXY | CEILING WHITE | | | GYP CEILING ONLY SOFT AREAS | ANIEMA OKON, 646-641-2196 |\n| **PORCELAIN TILE** | | | | | | | |\n| PT(A-1) | FLORIDA TILE | CALACATA | ZOX THICK | 36\" T.O.B. USED AT CORNERS WHERE PT(W.1) MEET | SECURITY WALL ABOVE SECURITY | PAMELA JAMES 917-226-8895 |\n| PT(A-2) | DALTILE | INDUSTRIAL COLLECTION | GREEN | ZOX THICK | 36\" T.O.B. USED AT CORNERS WHERE PT(W.1) MEET | SECURITY DEM SURROUND | PAMELA JAMES 917-226-8895 |\n| **SPECIAL WALL COVERING** |"}],"details":{"model":"anthropic/claude-opus-4-5","image":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-bellevue-hospital/drawings/pages/page_025.png","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1770063115098}}
{"type":"message","id":"4912cbf3","parentId":"189c9a02","timestamp":"2026-02-02T20:12:03.319Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01Hp1ZZFR7dpSFhAwrCqjWFS","name":"image","arguments":{"image":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-bellevue-hospital/drawings/pages/page_011.png","prompt":"This is A-201 Building Elevations for the Bellevue Hospital ED Ambulance Bay Addition. Extract ALL: 1) Building heights and floor-to-floor dimensions, 2) Exterior material callouts (masonry, metal panel, storefront, etc.), 3) Window/storefront locations and sizes, 4) Overall building dimensions (width, height). Be extremely detailed."}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_0149pPJnHFbYQD9Hq5M59Hjp","name":"image","arguments":{"image":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-bellevue-hospital/drawings/pages/page_020.png","prompt":"This is the Reflected Ceiling Plan A-501 for the Bellevue Hospital ED Ambulance Bay Addition. Extract ALL ceiling types, ceiling heights, light fixture locations, roof drain locations, and any roof plan information including roof area dimensions. Identify all rooms and their ceiling types."}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01LK4z26dyPPXN7dW2zavVLX","name":"image","arguments":{"image":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-bellevue-hospital/drawings/pages/page_010.png","prompt":"This is A-200 Exterior Components and Building Enclosure Systems. Extract ALL exterior wall assembly types, areas, R-values, material specifications, and any area takeoff data for the building enclosure. Look for wall types, roof types, and any square footage calculations."}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-opus-4-5","usage":{"input":1,"output":468,"cacheRead":52423,"cacheWrite":2201,"totalTokens":55093,"cost":{"input":0.000005,"output":0.0117,"cacheRead":0.0262115,"cacheWrite":0.013756250000000001,"total":0.05167275}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1770063115105}}
{"type":"message","id":"9cf6af91","parentId":"4912cbf3","timestamp":"2026-02-02T20:12:17.218Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01Hp1ZZFR7dpSFhAwrCqjWFS","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# A-200.00 — Exterior Components and Building Enclosure Systems\n\n## Sheet Information\n- **Project:** H+H Bellevue — ED Ambulance Bay Addition\n- **Address:** 462 1st Avenue, New York, NY 10016\n- **Architect:** Array Architects\n- **Date:** 09/25/25\n- **Project No.:** 6629\n- **Issue:** Issued Solution for Bid\n\n---\n\n## Building Enclosure System Schedule\n\nThe sheet contains a detailed **Building Enclosure System** table with the following assembly designations:\n\n| Code | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| **BES-01** | Insulated ballistic resistant aluminum sliding glass door, BOD Stanley dual shield security series |\n| **BES-02** | Insulated ballistic resistant exterior aluminum & glass storefront swing door, BOD 20 bullet proofing corp model |\n| **BES-03** | Opaque |\n| **BES-04** | Non-insulated ballistic resistant aluminum exterior storefront/sidelite, BOD 18 bullet proofing corp model, louvered |\n| **BES-04** | Non-insulated ballistic resistant interior aluminum sliding glass door, BOD Stanley dual shield security series |\n| **BES-05** | Brick veneer over exterior wall, brick to match existing, cold-side bond, 1\" air space, R-6.5 poly-iso insulation, air/water membrane, exterior sheathing/5/8\" gyp stud with R-19 batt insulation (2x6 SS) |\n| **BES-06** | Non-insulated ballistic resistant interior aluminum & glass storefront swing door, BOD 20 bullet proofing corp model, louvered |\n| **BES-07** | Existing brick wall to remain |\n| **BES-08** | Insulated exterior curtain wall, BOD Kawneer or equal, 1\" air space, R-6.5 poly-iso insulation, air/water membrane, 5/8\" densglass, 1-5/8\" metal stud with R-13 batt insulation/R-BP |\n|"}],"details":{"model":"anthropic/claude-opus-4-5","image":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-bellevue-hospital/drawings/pages/page_011.png","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1770063137201}}
{"type":"message","id":"cb1b241e","parentId":"9cf6af91","timestamp":"2026-02-02T20:12:30.882Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_0149pPJnHFbYQD9Hq5M59Hjp","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Analysis of Sheet A-400.00\n\n**Important Note:** This is **NOT** a Reflected Ceiling Plan (A-501). This sheet is **A-400.00 - INTERIOR ELEVATIONS** for the Bellevue Hospital ED Ambulance Bay Addition, dated 09/25/25, Issued Solution for Bid.\n\n## What This Sheet Contains\n\nThis sheet shows **interior elevation views** of various rooms/spaces:\n\n### Elevation Views Identified:\n\n**Row D-E (Upper):**\n- **C6** - Cart Wash - Exterior (1/4\" = 1'-0\")\n- **C5** - Vestibule (1/4\" = 1'-0\")\n\n**Row B (Middle):**\n- **B8** - NYPD Security Pick Up (1/4\" = 1'-0\")\n- **B7** - NYPD Security Pick Up (1/3\" = 1'-0\")\n- **B5** - Cart Wash (1/4\" = 1'-0\")\n- **B4** - Cart Wash (1/4\" = 1'-0\")\n- **B3** - Vestibule (1/4\" = 1'-0\")\n\n**Row A (Lower):**\n- **A8** - Security Check-In (1/4\" = 1'-0\")\n- **A6** - Security Check-In (1/4\" = 1'-0\")\n- **10** - Security Check-In (1/4\" = 1'-0\")\n- **11** - Security Check-In (1/4\" = 1'-0\")\n- **12** - Security Check-In (1/4\" = 1'-0\")\n\n### Elevation Keynotes (ED Addition):\n- **A2** - HSS post clad in aluminum to match storefront\n- **A25** - GYP BD over wall w/ rhinohold finish and ballistic resistant panel\n- **A3a** - Ballistic resistant storefront glazing & panel, BGS R&D\n- **A2b** - Interior ballistic storefront system w/ aluminum mullions & channel frame glazing bar as bullet proofing (UBR model)"}],"details":{"model":"anthropic/claude-opus-4-5","image":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-bellevue-hospital/drawings/pages/page_020.png","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1770063150865}}
{"type":"message","id":"a632427a","parentId":"cb1b241e","timestamp":"2026-02-02T20:12:38.158Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01LK4z26dyPPXN7dW2zavVLX","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This drawing (A-102.00) is an **Equipment Plan** for the ED Ambulance Bay Addition at H+H Bellevue, not a building enclosure or exterior wall assembly document. It shows equipment locations, symbols, and general equipment notes.\n\n**No exterior wall assembly types, R-values, material specifications, or area takeoff data** are present on this sheet. It contains no wall/roof section details or enclosure specifications.\n\nTo find that information, you would need sheets typically labeled:\n- **A-200 series** (exterior elevations/wall sections)\n- **A-500 series** (wall assembly details)\n- **Energy code compliance** drawings\n- **Specifications Division 07** (thermal/moisture protection)"}],"details":{"model":"anthropic/claude-opus-4-5","image":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-bellevue-hospital/drawings/pages/page_010.png","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1770063158152}}
