{"type":"message","id":"5b6f2467","parentId":"1259e0fb","timestamp":"2026-02-02T20:16:17.276Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01UNEAX23R3ax8NGnbWvi2wJ","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Sheet Identification\n\n**Sheet Number: S-001** — Superstructure Cover Sheet and Drawing List\n\n---\n\n## Extraction Limitations\n\nThis sheet (S-001) is the **cover sheet** for the superstructure package. It contains:\n\n- Drawing list\n- Loading schedule\n- Earthquake/wind design criteria\n- Special/progress inspections\n- Abbreviations\n- Site plan (small scale)\n\n**The Canopy Framing Plan is listed as sheet S-101** in the drawing list, but **S-101 is not the sheet shown here**. This image only shows S-001.\n\nTherefore, I **cannot extract** structural steel members, sizes, lengths, dimensions, or column counts from this sheet — that information would be on **S-101**, which is not provided.\n\n### What the Drawing List Confirms:\n| Sheet | Description |\n|-------|-------------|\n| S-001 | Superstructure - Cover Sheet and Drawing List |\n| S-002 | General Notes 1 |\n| S-003 | General Notes II |\n| **S-101** | **Canopy Framing Plan** |\n| S-200 | Typical Superstructure Details |\n| S-201 | Typical Superstructure Details |\n| S-300 | Building Sections |\n\n**To extract the requested structural steel information, please provide the S-101 sheet.**"}],"details":{"model":"anthropic/claude-opus-4-5","image":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-bellevue-hospital/drawings/pages/page_118.png","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1770063377270}}
