{"type":"message","id":"664a62b8","parentId":"e318d3c1","timestamp":"2026-02-02T20:16:35.719Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_016n24sVxasnkfzu7cmk9BFj","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# S-101 — CANOPY FRAMING PLAN\n\n**Project:** H+H Bellevue — ED Ambulance Bay Addition\n**Architect:** ARRAY Architects\n**Structural Engineer:** Yimaki A. Senik, P.E.\n**Project No.:** 6629\n**Date:** 06/06/25\n**Scale:** 1/4\" = 1'-0\" (View 1), 1-1/2\" = 1'-0\" (Views 3 & 4)\n\n---\n\n## OVERALL CANOPY DIMENSIONS\n\n- **Top of canopy steel:** EL 27'-0\" ± O/A\n- **Overall span (approx.):** ~49'-11-1/4\" (noted dimension on plan)\n- **Depth direction:** Multiple bays spanning between grid lines C through F\n\n---\n\n## GRID LINES\n\n- **Horizontal (N-S):** 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8\n- **Vertical (E-W):** A, AB, B, C, CB, D, DB, E, EB, F\n\n---\n\n## STRUCTURAL STEEL MEMBERS\n\n### Beams / Girders\n\n| Member Mark | Size | Length/Span | Notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Lintel beams | **L4x3.5, 2F - 7** | Various | Multiple locations at grid intersections |\n| Lintel | **L4x3.5, 2F - 11** | ~11'-0\" | At grids near line 3-4 |\n| Lintel | **T-1/2S, 2L 2F - 7** | — | Reinforced with angles |\n| HSS beams | **HSS6x2** | Various | Framing between columns |\n| Wide flange | **W8x10** | Various spans | Primary canopy beams (multiple locations) |\n| Beams | **W6x12** | Various | Secondary framing |\n| Channel/angle | **C6x13, 7S BELOW** | — | Below canopy framing |\n| Existing"}],"details":{"model":"anthropic/claude-opus-4-5","image":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/hhc-bellevue-hospital/drawings/pages/page_121.png","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1770063395693}}
