ering security consultant\n- **Item 59 unit mismatch** — Bid sheet says SF but should be EA for fire extinguisher cabinets\n- **ACU-1 duct routing conflicts with canopy steel** — Major coordination item\n- **Missing door ED-1-05** in schedule — verify if intentional"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-opus-4-5","usage":{"input":1,"output":810,"cacheRead":103555,"cacheWrite":5774,"totalTokens":110140,"cost":{"input":0.000005,"output":0.02025,"cacheRead":0.0517775,"cacheWrite":0.0360875,"total":0.10812}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1770063713429}}
